 "briefing": {
  "speaker": "thorne",
  "lines": [
   "Rowan. A freighter called the Patience of Stone has been broadcasting a distress loop from inside the Veil Nebula for two days. Independent registry, no flight plan on file.",
   "The Tellarch Compact has also asked us to keep an eye out for it. They say it's stolen. The Compact are signatories to the Kessel Accords, so officially, that request matters.",
   "Unofficially, I'd like to know why the Compact cares so much about one small freighter. Find it. Help whoever's aboard. Thorne out."
  ]
 },
 "bridge": {
  "onStart": [
   {
    "objective": "Locate the freighter Patience of Stone in the Veil Nebula",
    "id": "find"
   },
   {
    "if": {
     "memory": "choir_restored"
    },
    "then": [
     {
      "say": "venn",
      "text": "Captain - before we go. A message arrived from Kepos IV. Dr. Halvorsen says the Choir has started \"humming back\" when the children sing. He thought you would want to know."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "if": {
     "memory": "destroyed_choir"
    },
    "then": [
     {
      "say": "venn",
      "text": "Kepos IV reports the last of the colonists have been discharged. Eleven did not recover."
     },
     {
      "say": "okafor",
      "text": "...Let's go do some good, Captain."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
